# --- failure-pattern corpus (#495) ---
# Each project reproduces a failure from the v0.4–v0.6 20-OSS comparison that
# the corpus above missed. Pinned by commit SHA; the release tag and target:
#   sqlalchemy    rel_2_1_3        package under lib/
#   streamlit     1.65.0           pyproject under lib/
#   llama_index   v0.14.25         monorepo, no workspace table
#   transformers  v5.18.0          dynamic setup.py, lazy imports
#   openai-python v3.24.0          library-mode public API
#   langchain     langchain==1.4.3 non-UTF-8 fixtures, multi-package
