# --- orchestration plugin corpus (#1057) ---
# One user-side project per orchestration plugin (Dagster, Prefect, Scrapy), so
# the plugins' effect is measured on code they were written for. Each one holds
# the plugin's config (dg project / prefect.yaml / scrapy.cfg) at its root.
# None of them tags releases; pinned by the default branch's commit SHA on:
#   dagster-open-platform        2026-10-02
#   prefect-collection-registry  2026-06-16
#   open-gov-crawlers            2025-08-08
dagster-open-platform	app	medium	c29d915add170fdbc2a59a248e90ce6cbff1623f	https://github.com/dagster-io/dagster-open-platform
prefect-collection-registry	app	small	6be8519e91835916a26eab58c54c766dd3de59f1	https://github.com/PrefectHQ/prefect-collection-registry
open-gov-crawlers	app	medium	87bdeaac38aae3f21c96e87331fb1636dc5ad424	https://github.com/public-law/open-gov-crawlers
# --- diversity corpus ---
# The corpus above leans on web/HTTP libraries (pallets, encode), LLM tooling
# and Django apps, and all of it is pure Python. These projects cover what it
# had none of: scientific / data code, Cython and C extensions with meson-python
# or a custom build backend, setup.py / setup.cfg-only packaging, a test runner,
# a docs tool, a type checker, infrastructure automation, a terminal UI library
# and single-module packages. Selection and measurements are in
# docs/dev/oss-validation-report.md. Pinned by commit SHA; the release tag:
#   pandas          v3.1.0    meson-python, Cython
#   scikit-learn    1.9.1     meson-python, Cython, optional plotting deps
#   pytest          9.1.1     test runner, pytest11 plugins, setuptools-scm
#   rich            v15.0.0   terminal UI, poetry-core backend
#   sphinx          v9.2.0    docs tool, flit backend, extensions by name
#   ansible         v2.21.5   infrastructure automation, plugins by directory
#   aiohttp         v3.14.5   async networking, C extensions, setup.cfg
#   pillow          13.0.0    image library, C extensions, in-tree backend
#   boto3           1.43.119  cloud SDK, setup.py / setup.cfg only
#   six             1.17.0    single module, setup.py only
#   more-itertools  v11.2.1   small library, flit backend
#   httpie          3.2.4     CLI app, setup.py / setup.cfg only
#   mypy            v2.4.0    type checker, mypyc-compiled
